    "section_rrJezm": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_UBCGUg": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I'm the maker behind apopofjoy — a small joy atelier based in Penang. I started this because I kept noticing how the small, considered things in my own life — the pouch I reached for every morning, the little charm on a keychain, the colour of a bag — quietly shaped how my day felt. There was something powerful in that, and I wanted to make more of it for other people.</p><p>Every joy bag starts with a colourful nylon pouch finished with a soft gold zip pull and our little engraved disc. From there, you choose your path: grab one ready-made for an easy yes, or make it entirely your own with patches and embroidery — your name, your favourite characters, the details only you would think of.</p><p>We're starting with pouches because everyone needs something to carry their joy in. But apopofjoy was always meant to be bigger — an atelier for life's celebrations. Birthdays, graduations, festivals. Some made just for you, some ready to celebrate with. There's so much more coming.</p><p>For now, thank you for being here this early. Every order genuinely makes my day — I see your name on the label, I tuck a little extra joy in the parcel, and I think about how it might brighten someone's ordinary Tuesday. That's the whole point.</p><p>— with all my joy, JT 💛</p>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "center",
            "type_preset": "custom",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
