            },
            "text_ezrzTJ": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>say it slowly —a pop of joy.</p><p>A small, unexpected moment of delight.Personal. Heartfelt. The kind that catches you on an ordinary day and quietly makes it brighter.We used to think joy needed a reason. A birthday.A milestone. Something big.But the small days count too. The ordinary Tuesdays. The just-because moments.apopofjoy is here for all of them.This started because we believe joy shouldn't have to wait for a special occasion — and that the everyday stuff can feel a little less ordinary, and a lot more you.Some pieces are ready just as they are. Others, you make your own — a name, a colour, the little detail that makes it yours. Either way, it's made to make an ordinary day feel a little more like yours.It starts with bags and pouches. But it doesn't end there — bit by bit, we're building a whole home for celebration, the everyday kind and the confetti-everywhere kind.Because joy lives in the details. And it's worth carrying with you.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "paragraph",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
